window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A pack princess omega, four alphas, and a family rivalry that brings them all together. </p> <p>Life as the only daughter of the powerful Quinn pack alpha is everything you could imagine it to be. Only to me, it's a gilded cage.</p> <p>When that cage is rattled by a family feud that dates back to before I was born, secrets are spilled that spur me into taking control of my life in a way that I never thought possible.</p> <p>With the help of three strangers who share the same blood, and a man who knows me better than I thought, I finally learn how to fly free.</p> <p>Previously published as <i>Sugar Baby: Knot Your Princess</i>, but with significant and in-depth changes to characters and plot.</p> <p>This is a non-shifting reverse-harem omegaverse stand-alone with some content warnings. Please refer to the preface regarding these.</p> <p>Please note that this audiobook is set in England, with British characters using British English.</p>"; 
